{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain food and water to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt creatures and obtain their transformation cards, which you can use to transform into the corresponding creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has different abilities and survival methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All food has an expiration date, and after expiration, it becomes toxic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the [WASD] keys on your keyboard to move around, and the mouse to control the camera.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[C]</strong> to open the character details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[I]</strong> to open the character inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[K]</strong> to open the character skills details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[F]</strong> to pick up items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[~]</strong> to show a hidden mouse cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Tab]</strong> to switch characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Shift]</strong> to move faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Ctrl]</strong> to move slower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Alt]</strong> to lock the camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the game view using the mouse wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Q, E]</strong> and the left and right mouse buttons each have different functions for each character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set the key bindings to your preference.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948830?t=1769916531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948830?t=1769916531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948830/b9b79eb99949a24096ff457e40e19eaedc6f79ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769916531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948830/b9b79eb99949a24096ff457e40e19eaedc6f79ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769916531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain food and water to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt creatures and obtain their transformation cards, which you can use to transform into the corresponding creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has different abilities and survival methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All food has an expiration date, and after expiration, it becomes toxic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the [WASD] keys on your keyboard to move around, and the mouse to control the camera.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[C]</strong> to open the character details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[I]</strong> to open the character inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[K]</strong> to open the character skills details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[F]</strong> to pick up items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[~]</strong> to show a hidden mouse cursor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Tab]</strong> to switch characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Shift]</strong> to move faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Ctrl]</strong> to move slower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>[Alt]</strong> to lock the camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the game view using the mouse wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Q, E]</strong> and the left and right mouse buttons each have different functions for each character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set the key bindings to your preference.</p>","developers":["QIPAWORLD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948830/26c9977c65e1ce3141989223e3cc7f1c9925bc2b/header.jpg?t=1769916531","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/511142436/29788107d2888663172fc9ecafb1eb6d94b2aec3/1769416820/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769418159","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/511142436/29788107d2888663172fc9ecafb1eb6d94b2aec3/1769416820/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769418159","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/511142436/29788107d2888663172fc9ecafb1eb6d94b2aec3/1769416820/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769418159","id":257272811,"name":"Slime Simulator2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257272811/f69b5f1a4c7c0061f3b336a2ce01e3739b87da24/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769418159"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/1600978065/2f8f705fa5debbabd36b2289e38c285f98774b93/1769416619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769436484","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/1600978065/2f8f705fa5debbabd36b2289e38c285f98774b93/1769416619/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769436484","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948830/1600978065/2f8f705fa5debbabd36b2289e38c285f98774b93/1769416619/hl